Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] FieldState clear to init; NULL slots in file loader

HEAP.zero(&FIELDSTG_state, 100) is the PS1 prefix before method pointers;
on LP64 those sit later — clear through offsetof(FieldState, init).
WSTAG780 (and other stages) leave FieldState.slots NULL; FIELDSTG_createTriggers
already guards, but FIELDSTG_requestSlotFiles did not and SEGV'd on host.

